  "sn15.12:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … tatra kho bhagavā … ",
  "sn15.12:1.2": "anamataggoyaṃ bhikkhave saṃsāro … ",
  "sn15.12:1.3": "yaṃ bhikkhave passeyyātha sukhitaṃ susajjitaṃ niṭṭha mettha gantabbaṃ ",
  "sn15.12:1.4": "amhehi 1 evarūpaṃ paccanubhūtaṃ iminā dīghena addhunāti ",
  "sn15.12:1.5": "taṃ kissa hetu ",
  "sn15.12:1.6": "anamataggoyaṃ bhikkhave saṃsāro ",
  "sn15.12:1.7": "pubbā koṭi na paññāyati …pe… ",
  "sn15.12:1.8": "alaṃ vimuccitunti. ",
  "sn15.12:1.9": "dutiyaṃ. "
}
